        /// and naming them in types is a 403. A stream closes within a few seconds once its key is
        /// revoked, its person leaves the team or its inbox is gone; it is also closed every ten
        /// minutes or so, and the client reconnects with Last-Event-ID. Streams are capped per key
        /// and per team on each API process (429 too_many_streams).
